  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate and Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports improved climate resilience in small holder agriculture (focusing on PNG and the Pacific) and investigates opportunities for smallholders that may arise from climate mitigation. It covers activities in carbon and agroforestry, technology for resilient farming in the face of climate change and research into climate change impacts.</narrative>
  </description>
